# Face Rules Test (counts for the sidebar face rules)

This file has fixed numbers of tasks so that the sidebar entries of the group
"Face Rules" in `.altodo-locals.el_` show known counts:

| Entry | Count | Expected color |
|---|---|---|
| Done (Color by Count) | 5 | red (>= 5) |
| Open (Title Color) | 10 | red (>= 5) |
| Priority (Count Color) | 2 | orange for the count only |
| Star (Both Colors) | 3 | gold title, red count |

Use: copy `.altodo-locals.el_` next to this file as `.altodo-locals.el`, open
this file, and run `M-x altodo-sidebar-show`.

## Test Cases for :face-rules and :count-face-rules

